  "worked_solution": "We can combine the two $\\sqrt[3]{21}$ terms together, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7\\sqrt[3]{21}-3\\sqrt[3]{21} & = \\\\ (7-3)\\sqrt[3]{21} & = \\\\ 4\\sqrt[3]{21} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
